    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef copy_bounded(memory, start, size, data):\n    result = list(memory)\n    for i, value in enumerate(data[:size]):\n        result[start + i] = value\n    return result\n\nmemory = [0] * 8 + [85, 83, 69, 82]\nresult = copy_bounded(memory, 0, 8, [1, 2, 3])\nprint(result[:8])\nprint(result[8:])\nresult = copy_bounded(memory, 0, 8, list(range(1, 13)))\nprint(result[:8])\nprint(result[8:])\n```",
